[en.CHARACTER_BLOSSOM_BURST_NAME]
Blossom Burst

[en.CHARACTER_BLOSSOM_BURST_DESC]
A calm and rational Kirin, who almost caused a riot due to a rare moment of impulsiveness of hers, leading to the occurrence of the “Silence”. She served as the director of the Kirin Commune Freight Bureau during the “Silence” and later resigned to go to Narrow Gate, where her ancestors are from.

[en.CHARACTER_BLOSSOM_BURST_TOOLTIP]
Blossom Burst resigned and left the Peaks of Peril, no longer holding any position in the capital region or the central government.

[en.CHARACTER_BLOSSOM_BURST_TOOLTIP_CRIMINAL]
After the smuggling key case, Blossom Burst has fled the country.

[zh.CHARACTER_BLOSSOM_BURST_NAME]
繁花

[zh.CHARACTER_BLOSSOM_BURST_DESC]
一只冷静而理性的麒麟，却因少见的一时冲动险些造成逆麟之乱，导致了“静默”的发生。“静默”期间曾担任麒麟社群货运局长，后辞职前往狭关，她的祖籍。

[zh.CHARACTER_BLOSSOM_BURST_TOOLTIP]
繁花主动辞职离开了险崇峰，不再担任首都地区与中央政府的职务。

[zh.CHARACTER_BLOSSOM_BURST_TOOLTIP_CRIMINAL]
走私专案后，繁花已经潜逃出境。
